        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cython Cat</strong> is a openworld speed platformer, play as <strong>Miru</strong> and explore the lands of the <strong>Cython Ruins</strong>. Find shards, keys and furballs, scattered around to unlock different areas. Enjoy running around the world, at high speeds. Challenge your speedrunning skills in the <strong>Jungle Temple</strong> to get the highest rank! Fight <strong>Terru</strong>, the final boss who remains at rest in his secret cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008740/extras/529f775cc2b9ab7ecedf9da0a85347dd.poster.avif?t=1764569178\" aria-label=\"A gif displaying general gameplay of Cython Cat\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008740/extras/529f775cc2b9ab7ecedf9da0a85347dd.webm?t=1764569178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring a big open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Speed platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008740/extras/9d9195686933c871fc152dea1dfe207c.avif?t=1764569178\" alt=\"Miru the cat asking you to play the game!\" width=435 height=431 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
